    bottomLine: "Best smartwatch for runners in the Apple ecosystem—bright rugged display, dual-frequency GPS, shorter dedicated GPS battery. I'd shortlist it when you want best iPhone app ecosystem, Apple Pay, and cellular options. I'd pause if still shorter continuous GPS endurance than Garmin/COROS ultras shows up often in your week.",
    verdict: "Buy the Apple Watch Ultra 3 when its main job matches most of your week — not as a default for every session. It earns a look for best iPhone app ecosystem, Apple Pay, and cellular options or rugged titanium build with dual-frequency GPS and siren. Look elsewhere if still shorter continuous GPS endurance than Garmin/COROS ultras.",
    score: 87,
    summary: "Best smartwatch for runners in the Apple ecosystem—bright rugged display, dual-frequency GPS, shorter dedicated GPS battery. I'd shortlist it when you want best iPhone app ecosystem, Apple Pay, and cellular options. I'd pause if still shorter continuous GPS endurance than Garmin/COROS ultras shows up often in your week.",
    reviewerId: "author-kitletics-editorial",
