    sections: [{"id":"sec-overview","heading":"What it is","body":"Previous-generation plush Brooks daily trainer, often available at a discount vs Glycerin 22.\n\nBrooks Glycerin 21 is built for a specific job in the category — use that job as your first filter.\n\nI'd shortlist it when you want soft ride or value when discounted.\n\nI'd pause if superseded by Glycerin 22 would show up often in your week.\n\nBottom line: Previous-generation plush Brooks daily trainer, often available at a discount vs Glycerin 22. I'd shortlist it when you want soft ride. I'd pause if superseded by Glycerin 22 shows up often in your week.","evidenceIds":["ev-catalog-mfr","ev-catalog-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-verified-specs","heading":"Key specs","body":"Here are the numbers that matter for the Brooks Glycerin 21:\n\n• Weight: 283 g\n• Drop: 10 mm\n• Heel Stack: 38 mm\n• Forefoot Stack: 28 mm\n• Cushion Level: maximum\n• Stability: neutral\n• Terrain: road\n• Width Options: narrow, standard, wide, extra-wide\n• Plate: No\n• Plate Material: none\n• Cushion Feel: plush\n• Training Types: easy, long, recovery\n\nWeight and stack shape how protective or lively a shoe feels; drop and geometry change the transition; stability and terrain labels tell you the intended job; width options change who can wear it. For watches and other gear, treat battery, sensors and materials the same way — as filters, not the whole story.\n\nSpecs will not tell you blister risk, late-run foam feel or whether a guidance system suits your gait. Try before you commit when you can, or buy somewhere returns are easy.","evidenceIds":["ev-catalog-mfr","ev-catalog-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-strengths","heading":"Where it is strongest","body":"I'd buy the Brooks Glycerin 21 when these outcomes match what you need most weeks:\n\nWhat it does well\n• Soft ride\n• Value when discounted\n\nThe standout is soft ride. If that is your main weekly need, keep going. If not, check trade-offs and alternatives.\n\nBest for: You want soft ride as a weekly priority — that is the Glycerin 21's main job; Most of your sessions line up with value when discounted more than an adjacent specialty role.","evidenceIds":["ev-catalog-mfr","ev-catalog-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-tradeoffs","heading":"Trade-offs & limits","body":"The Brooks Glycerin 21 is not trying to do every job. These are the compromises to weigh:\n\n• Superseded by Glycerin 22\n\nSkip it if: You need to avoid superseded by Glycerin 22 — forcing the Glycerin 21 into that job usually disappoints.\n\nThose limits matter when they hit your primary sessions — not when they only show up once a month. If your week sits outside this product's job, pick a peer built for that job instead.","evidenceIds":["ev-catalog-mfr","ev-catalog-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-usecase","heading":"Who it is for","body":"I'd buy the Brooks Glycerin 21 when most of your weekly sessions match what it does well.\n\nBest when you want\n• You want soft ride as a weekly priority — that is the Glycerin 21's main job\n• Most of your sessions line up with value when discounted more than an adjacent specialty role\n• Soft ride\n• Value when discounted\n\nLook elsewhere when\n• You need to avoid superseded by Glycerin 22 — forcing the Glycerin 21 into that job usually disappoints\n• Superseded by Glycerin 22\n\nIf more than half your week sits in the “look elsewhere” list, open the alternatives instead of forcing a compromise.","evidenceIds":["ev-catalog-mfr","ev-catalog-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-value","heading":"Value","body":"You are mainly paying for soft ride or value when discounted.\n\nYou are also accepting superseded by Glycerin 22 — fine when that is not your weekly mix.\n\nStrongest value for: You want soft ride as a weekly priority — that is the Glycerin 21's main job; Most of your sessions line up with value when discounted more than an adjacent specialty role.\n\nWeaker value for: You need to avoid superseded by Glycerin 22 — forcing the Glycerin 21 into that job usually disappoints.\n\nCheck live street price in the offers module. I'd pay the premium when the role is clear; otherwise compare the linked alternatives or a prior generation on sale.","evidenceIds":["ev-catalog-mfr","ev-catalog-editorial"]}],
    pros: ["Value when discounted","maximum cushioning for the sessions it was built for","Width options include narrow, standard, wide, extra-wide"],
