    bottomLine: "Ultralight AMOLED value runner with dual-frequency GPS and standout stated battery for the price. I'd shortlist it when you want just 32 g with nylon band—easy all-day racing weight. I'd pause if no full offline maps (step up to Apex 4 / Pace Pro) shows up often in your week.",
    verdict: "Buy the COROS Pace 4 when its main job matches most of your week — not as a default for every session. It earns a look for just 32 g with nylon band—easy all-day racing weight or 41 hours all-systems / 31 hours dual-frequency GPS claims. Look elsewhere if no full offline maps (step up to Apex 4 / Pace Pro).",
