    bottomLine: "Tubular waist belt for phone, keys, and soft gels without bouncing zippers. I'd shortlist it when you want low-bounce stretch tube design. I'd pause if sweat can reach phone without a case shows up often in your week.",
    verdict: "Buy the FlipBelt Classic when its main job matches most of your week — not as a default for every session. It earns a look for low-bounce stretch tube design or simple no-zipper access. Look elsewhere if sweat can reach phone without a case.",
    score: 85,
    summary: "Tubular waist belt for phone, keys, and soft gels without bouncing zippers. I'd shortlist it when you want low-bounce stretch tube design. I'd pause if sweat can reach phone without a case shows up often in your week.",
    reviewerId: "author-kitletics-editorial",
