    reviewType: "expert-research",
    bottomLine: "Rugged adventure watch (MIP Solar or AMOLED) with strong battery, flashlight, and outdoor tools. I'd shortlist it when you want tough fiber-reinforced case and metal-reinforced bezel. I'd pause if no full offline maps like Enduro/Fenix shows up often in your week.",
    verdict: "Buy the Garmin Instinct 3 when its main job matches most of your week — not as a default for every session. It earns a look for tough fiber-reinforced case and metal-reinforced bezel, excellent stated battery or especially with Solar charging. Look elsewhere if no full offline maps like Enduro/Fenix.",
