    sections: [{"id":"sec-overview","heading":"What it is","body":"Value teardrop Lok for progressing beginners who want a bit more output than ultra-soft round starters.\n\nLok Maxx Flow is built for a specific job in the category — use that job as your first filter.\n\nI'd shortlist it when you want approachable hybrid shape, strong value or room to grow into club play.\n\nI'd pause if not a tour-stiff power diamond or fewer independent lab measurements would show up often in your week.\n\nBottom line: Value teardrop Lok for progressing beginners who want a bit more output than ultra-soft round starters. I'd shortlist it when you want approachable hybrid shape. I'd pause if not a tour-stiff power diamond shows up often in your week.","evidenceIds":["ev-wave26-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-verified-specs","heading":"Key specs","body":"Here are the numbers that matter for the Lok Maxx Flow:\n\n• Balance: medium\n• Shape: teardrop\n• Core: soft/medium EVA\n• Weight Min: 350 g\n• Weight Max: 370 g\n• Thickness: 38 mm\n• Face: fiberglass/carbon\n• Sweet Spot: medium-large\n• Power Positioning: medium\n• Control Positioning: medium-high\n• playerLevel: beginner-intermediate\n\nWeight and stack shape how protective or lively a shoe feels; drop and geometry change the transition; stability and terrain labels tell you the intended job; width options change who can wear it. For watches and other gear, treat battery, sensors and materials the same way — as filters, not the whole story.\n\nSpecs will not tell you blister risk, late-run foam feel or whether a guidance system suits your gait. Try before you commit when you can, or buy somewhere returns are easy.","evidenceIds":["ev-wave26-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-performance","heading":"Performance","body":"Value teardrop Lok for progressing beginners who want a bit more output than ultra-soft round starters.\n\nPerformance for the Lok Maxx Flow should be read through intended use. Category-leading numbers in the wrong session still feel like a miss.\n\nWhere it is set up to perform\n• Approachable hybrid shape\n• Strong value\n• Room to grow into club play\n\nWhere it is less convincing\n• Not a tour-stiff power diamond\n• Fewer independent lab measurements\n\nBest performance fit: You want approachable hybrid shape as a weekly priority — that is the Maxx Flow's main job; Most of your sessions line up with strong value more than an adjacent specialty role; Most of your sessions line up with room to grow into club play more than an adjacent specialty role.\n\nWeaker performance fit: You need to avoid not a tour-stiff power diamond — forcing the Maxx Flow into that job usually disappoints; You need to avoid fewer independent lab measurements on this model.\n\nJudge it for the sessions it was built for. A race shoe will “win” a sprint feel test that a daily trainer was never meant to take — that does not make the trainer bad.","evidenceIds":["ev-wave26-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-strengths","heading":"Where it is strongest","body":"I'd buy the Lok Maxx Flow when these outcomes match what you need most weeks:\n\nWhat it does well\n• Approachable hybrid shape\n• Strong value\n• Room to grow into club play\n\nThe standout is approachable hybrid shape. If that is your main weekly need, keep going. If not, check trade-offs and alternatives.\n\nBest for: You want approachable hybrid shape as a weekly priority — that is the Maxx Flow's main job; Most of your sessions line up with strong value more than an adjacent specialty role; Most of your sessions line up with room to grow into club play more than an adjacent specialty role.","evidenceIds":["ev-wave26-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-tradeoffs","heading":"Trade-offs & limits","body":"The Lok Maxx Flow is not trying to do every job. These are the compromises to weigh:\n\n• Not a tour-stiff power diamond\n• Fewer independent lab measurements\n\nSkip it if: You need to avoid not a tour-stiff power diamond — forcing the Maxx Flow into that job usually disappoints; You need to avoid fewer independent lab measurements on this model.\n\nThose limits matter when they hit your primary sessions — not when they only show up once a month. If your week sits outside this product's job, pick a peer built for that job instead.","evidenceIds":["ev-wave26-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-usecase","heading":"Who it is for","body":"I'd buy the Lok Maxx Flow when most of your weekly sessions match what it does well.\n\nBest when you want\n• You want approachable hybrid shape as a weekly priority — that is the Maxx Flow's main job\n• Most of your sessions line up with strong value more than an adjacent specialty role\n• Most of your sessions line up with room to grow into club play more than an adjacent specialty role\n• Approachable hybrid shape\n• Strong value\n• Room to grow into club play\n\nLook elsewhere when\n• You need to avoid not a tour-stiff power diamond — forcing the Maxx Flow into that job usually disappoints\n• You need to avoid fewer independent lab measurements on this model\n• Not a tour-stiff power diamond\n• Fewer independent lab measurements\n\nIf more than half your week sits in the “look elsewhere” list, open the alternatives instead of forcing a compromise.","evidenceIds":["ev-wave26-editorial"]},{"id":"sec-value","heading":"Value","body":"You are mainly paying for approachable hybrid shape, strong value or room to grow into club play.\n\nYou are also accepting not a tour-stiff power diamond or fewer independent lab measurements — fine when that is not your weekly mix.\n\nStrongest value for: You want approachable hybrid shape as a weekly priority — that is the Maxx Flow's main job; Most of your sessions line up with strong value more than an adjacent specialty role; Most of your sessions line up with room to grow into club play more than an adjacent specialty role.\n\nWeaker value for: You need to avoid not a tour-stiff power diamond — forcing the Maxx Flow into that job usually disappoints; You need to avoid fewer independent lab measurements on this model.\n\nCheck live street price in the offers module. I'd pay the premium when the role is clear; otherwise compare the linked alternatives or a prior generation on sale.","evidenceIds":["ev-wave26-editorial"]}],
