    verdict: "Buy the Naked Running Band when its main job matches most of your week — not as a default for every session. It earns a look for industry-leading low bounce when sized correctly or can hold soft flasks without a dedicated holster belt. Look elsewhere if sweat reaches contents — phone case recommended.",
