    whoShouldAvoid: ["You need not a traditional medial-post shoe — look at Arahi 7 or a clearer specialist instead of forcing the React Infinity Run 4","Your must-haves conflict with a React Infinity Run 4 trade-off: can feel bulky","You need technical trail grip or a dedicated race plate as the primary job — this platform is aimed elsewhere"],
