    bottomLine: "Race-minimal NNormal vest for fast trail and ultra efforts — stripped storage for flasks and essentials when you refuse adventure-pack bulk. I'd shortlist it when you want true race-minimal profile for fast mountain efforts. I'd pause if little forgiveness for big jackets or adventure days shows up often in your week.",
