    bottomLine: "Outdoor AMOLED adventure watch with offline maps, dual-band GPS, LED flashlight, and long training battery. I'd shortlist it when you want bright 1.5″ AMOLED with free offline outdoor maps. I'd pause if training coaching less deep than Garmin/Polar flagships shows up often in your week.",
