    bottomLine: "Portable calf-focused pneumatic compression sleeves for travel and hotel recovery routines — manufacturer recovery claims exist; treat as a comfort aid on race weekends. I'd shortlist it when you want actually fits in a race bag unlike full Normatec 3. I'd pause if calves only — not full-leg coverage shows up often in your week.",
    verdict: "Buy the Hyperice Normatec Go when its main job matches most of your week — not as a default for every session. It earns a look for actually fits in a race bag unlike full Normatec 3 or targets calves — a common runner soft-tissue focus. Look elsewhere if calves only — not full-leg coverage.",
